    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let $P=QR.$ What is the value of ${p}_{22}$, if\n\n$$\nQ=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -5 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 3 & -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,R=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & -1\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$\n\n${p}_{22}=$\n{{field-1}}",
